{"id": "fact-01-batch-size", "question": "CLIP 训练用的 minibatch 有多大？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["1fc956711b1d99f17c09102e6f73ff2e"], "expectedFileNames": ["01-clip-radford-2021.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["57"], "expectedEvidence": ["32,768"], "referenceAnswer": "使用了非常大的 minibatch：32,768。"}
{"id": "fact-01-rn50x64-gpus", "question": "最大的 ResNet 模型 RN50x64 训练花了多少时间和算力？", "split": "test", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["1fc956711b1d99f17c09102e6f73ff2e"], "expectedFileNames": ["01-clip-radford-2021.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["60"], "expectedEvidence": ["18 days", "592 V100 GPUs"], "referenceAnswer": "RN50x64 在 592 块 V100 GPU 上训练了 18 天。"}
{"id": "fact-01-best-model", "question": "论文里默认报告结果的 CLIP 是指哪个具体模型？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["1fc956711b1d99f17c09102e6f73ff2e"], "expectedFileNames": ["01-clip-radford-2021.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["61"], "expectedEvidence": ["ViT-L/14@336px"], "referenceAnswer": "除非特别说明，论文中的 CLIP 指 ViT-L/14@336px——在 336 像素分辨率上再预训练一个 epoch 的 ViT-L/14，作者发现它表现最好。"}
{"id": "fact-01-zeroshot-imagenet", "question": "CLIP 零样本分类在 ImageNet 上的 top-1 准确率是多少？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["1fc956711b1d99f17c09102e6f73ff2e"], "expectedFileNames": ["01-clip-radford-2021.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["75"], "expectedEvidence": ["76.2"], "referenceAnswer": "76.2%（把概念验证阶段的 11.5% 大幅提升而来）；top-5 准确率 95%，与 Inception-V4 相当。"}
{"id": "para-01-polysemy", "question": "为什么类别名单独喂给 CLIP 文本编码器会出问题？论文举了什么例子？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["1fc956711b1d99f17c09102e6f73ff2e"], "expectedFileNames": ["01-clip-radford-2021.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["83"], "expectedEvidence": ["polysemy", "construction cranes"], "referenceAnswer": "一词多义（polysemy）：缺少上下文时文本编码器无法判断词义。论文例子：ImageNet 里既有建筑起重机（construction cranes）也有会飞的鹤（cranes that fly）；Oxford-IIIT Pet 里的 boxer 从上下文看是狗的品种，但对文本编码器来说也可能是运动员。"}
{"id": "para-01-prompt-template", "question": "CLIP 用什么提示模板来弥合预训练文本分布的差距？效果如何？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["1fc956711b1d99f17c09102e6f73ff2e"], "expectedFileNames": ["01-clip-radford-2021.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["88"], "expectedEvidence": ["A photo of a {label}"], "referenceAnswer": "默认模板「A photo of a {label}.」——因为预训练配对文本通常是完整句子而不是单词，这个模板帮助指明文本描述的是图像内容，仅此一项就把 ImageNet 准确率提高了 1.3%。"}
{"id": "para-01-prompt-gain", "question": "类别名改写、提示工程和集成平均能带来多少零样本分类提升？在多少个数据集上统计的？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["1fc956711b1d99f17c09102e6f73ff2e"], "expectedFileNames": ["01-clip-radford-2021.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["81"], "expectedEvidence": ["almost 5 points", "36 datasets"], "referenceAnswer": "在 36 个数据集上平均提升近 5 个点（almost 5 points），相当于基线零样本方法多花 4 倍算力的收益，而摊销后几乎是免费的。"}
{"id": "multi-01-ensemble-space", "question": "CLIP 的零样本分类器集成在什么空间进行？为什么这样设计？", "split": "dev", "type": "multi", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["1fc956711b1d99f17c09102e6f73ff2e"], "expectedFileNames": ["01-clip-radford-2021.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["35"], "expectedEvidence": ["embedding space"], "referenceAnswer": "在嵌入空间（embedding space）而不是概率空间集成：可以缓存一组平均化后的文本嵌入，摊销后集成的计算成本与单个分类器相同。"}
{"id": "multi-01-benchmark-scope", "question": "CLIP 在多大范围的基准上验证了零样本迁移？覆盖哪些任务类型？", "split": "test", "type": "multi", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["1fc956711b1d99f17c09102e6f73ff2e"], "expectedFileNames": ["01-clip-radford-2021.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["6"], "expectedEvidence": ["geo-localization", "OCR"], "referenceAnswer": "在 30 多个现有计算机视觉数据集上做了基准测试，任务包括 OCR、视频动作识别、地理定位（geo-localization）和多种细粒度物体分类等。"}
{"id": "neg-01-clip-cost", "question": "CLIP 那份 4 亿对图文的预训练数据集采购花了多少美元？", "split": "dev", "type": "neg", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": true, "expectedFileMd5s": ["1fc956711b1d99f17c09102e6f73ff2e"], "expectedFileNames": ["01-clip-radford-2021.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["4"], "expectedEvidence": ["400 million (image, text) pairs"], "referenceAnswer": "论文没有提到数据集的采购成本，只说明它包含从互联网收集的 4 亿（400 million）对（图像，文本）数据；应说明资料中无此信息，不能编造数字。"}
{"id": "neg-01-clip-julia", "question": "CLIP 发布的预训练代码是用 Julia 语言写的吗？", "split": "test", "type": "neg", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": true, "expectedFileMd5s": ["1fc956711b1d99f17c09102e6f73ff2e"], "expectedFileNames": ["01-clip-radford-2021.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["9"], "expectedEvidence": ["https://github.com/OpenAI/CLIP"], "referenceAnswer": "问题前提错误：论文只说代码和预训练模型权重发布在 https://github.com/OpenAI/CLIP，全文没有提到 Julia 或实现语言；不能顺着编造。"}
{"id": "fact-02-dataset-name", "question": "DINOv2 构建的精选预训练数据集叫什么名字？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["cf7a4fe0f316cba2a4727a24ba185527"], "expectedFileNames": ["02-dinov2-oquab-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["32"], "expectedEvidence": ["LVD-142M"], "referenceAnswer": "LVD-142M——通过从大规模未整理（uncurated）数据中检索与若干精选数据集相近的图像组装而成，规模 1.42 亿张图。"}
