{"id": "fact-02-retrieval-encoder", "question": "DINOv2 数据管线用什么网络计算图像嵌入来做检索？用什么距离？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["cf7a4fe0f316cba2a4727a24ba185527"], "expectedFileNames": ["02-dinov2-oquab-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["36"], "expectedEvidence": ["ViT-H/16", "cosine-similarity"], "referenceAnswer": "用在 ImageNet-22k 上预训练的自监督 ViT-H/16 计算图像嵌入，以余弦相似度（cosine-similarity）作为图像间距离；检索时不依赖任何元数据或文本。"}
