{"id": "fact-02-cluster-scale", "question": "生产 LVD-142M 数据集用了多大规模的集群、花了多久？", "split": "test", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["cf7a4fe0f316cba2a4727a24ba185527"], "expectedFileNames": ["02-dinov2-oquab-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["38"], "expectedEvidence": ["20 nodes", "8 V100-32GB GPUs", "less than two days"], "referenceAnswer": "分布式跑在一个 20 节点、每节点 8 块 V100-32GB GPU 的集群上，整个去重+检索处理不到两天完成。"}
{"id": "fact-02-vitg-params", "question": "DINOv2 最大的 ViT-g 主干有多少参数？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["cf7a4fe0f316cba2a4727a24ba185527"], "expectedFileNames": ["02-dinov2-oquab-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["49"], "expectedEvidence": ["1.1B parameters"], "referenceAnswer": "ViT-g 主干有 1.1B（11 亿）参数。"}
{"id": "fact-02-vitg-dim", "question": "DINOv2 的 ViT-g 与原始 ViT-g 设计在维度上有何不同？为什么？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["cf7a4fe0f316cba2a4727a24ba185527"], "expectedFileNames": ["02-dinov2-oquab-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["49"], "expectedEvidence": ["1536 with 24 heads", "1408 with 16 heads"], "referenceAnswer": "为了最大化计算效率（每头嵌入维度取 64 的倍数、总维度取 256 的倍数时 GPU 效率最好），嵌入维度用 1536 配 24 个头（每头 64 维），而不是原始的 1408 维 16 头（每头 88 维）；实验显示最终精度没有显著差异。"}
{"id": "fact-02-losses", "question": "DINOv2 的预训练目标由哪几部分组合而成？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["cf7a4fe0f316cba2a4727a24ba185527"], "expectedFileNames": ["02-dinov2-oquab-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["39"], "expectedEvidence": ["DINO and iBOT", "centering of SwAV"], "referenceAnswer": "判别式自监督方法：DINO 损失与 iBOT 损失组合，再加上 SwAV 的中心化（centering）；另外还加了让特征分散的正则化和短期高分辨率训练阶段。"}
{"id": "para-02-koleo", "question": "DINOv2 加的 KoLeo 正则化是做什么的？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["cf7a4fe0f316cba2a4727a24ba185527"], "expectedFileNames": ["02-dinov2-oquab-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["45"], "expectedEvidence": ["uniform span of the features"], "referenceAnswer": "KoLeo 正则化鼓励一个 batch 内的特征均匀铺开（uniform span of the features），它源自 Kozachenko-Leonenko 微分熵估计器；计算前先把特征做 ℓ2 归一化。"}
{"id": "para-02-resolution", "question": "DINOv2 在预训练末期把图像分辨率提高到多少？为什么不在全程用高分辨率？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["cf7a4fe0f316cba2a4727a24ba185527"], "expectedFileNames": ["02-dinov2-oquab-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["46"], "expectedEvidence": ["518×518"], "referenceAnswer": "在预训练末期的短阶段把分辨率提高到 518×518；因为高分辨率训练时间和显存开销大，全程使用代价过高，而高分辨率对分割/检测等像素级任务很重要。"}
{"id": "multi-02-distill", "question": "DINOv2 的小模型系列是怎么得到的？蒸馏时怎么训练学生网络？", "split": "test", "type": "multi", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["cf7a4fe0f316cba2a4727a24ba185527"], "expectedFileNames": ["02-dinov2-oquab-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["57"], "expectedEvidence": ["Knowledge distillation", "two global crops"], "referenceAnswer": "用知识蒸馏（Knowledge distillation）：1B 参数的 ViT-g 当老师，蒸馏出一系列更小模型（在多数基准上超过 OpenCLIP）；学生训练用掩码和随机深度，并在两个全局裁剪（two global crops）上施加 iBOT 损失，评估时取学生的 EMA。"}
{"id": "multi-02-dedup", "question": "DINOv2 数据管线的去重步骤具体做了哪些事？", "split": "dev", "type": "multi", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["cf7a4fe0f316cba2a4727a24ba185527"], "expectedFileNames": ["02-dinov2-oquab-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["35"], "expectedEvidence": ["copy detection pipeline", "near-duplicate"], "referenceAnswer": "对未整理数据应用 Pizzi 等人的 copy detection pipeline 移除近重复（near-duplicate）图像，以降低冗余、增加多样性；还移除了与本工作使用的任何基准测试集或验证集近重复的图像。"}
{"id": "neg-02-dinov2-chinese", "question": "DINOv2 的预训练数据集里包含多少条中文图文对？", "split": "dev", "type": "neg", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": true, "expectedFileMd5s": ["cf7a4fe0f316cba2a4727a24ba185527"], "expectedFileNames": ["02-dinov2-oquab-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["32"], "expectedEvidence": ["LVD-142M"], "referenceAnswer": "问题前提不成立：DINOv2 的 LVD-142M 是纯图像数据集，自监督预训练不使用文本标注，资料中没有任何中文图文对的统计；不能编造数字。"}
{"id": "neg-02-dinov2-license", "question": "DINOv2 的模型权重用什么商业授权发布、单次下载定价多少？", "split": "test", "type": "neg", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": true, "expectedFileMd5s": ["cf7a4fe0f316cba2a4727a24ba185527"], "expectedFileNames": ["02-dinov2-oquab-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["50"], "expectedEvidence": ["github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2"], "referenceAnswer": "资料只给出开源代码地址 https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2，没有讨论商业授权或定价；应说明资料中无此信息，不能编造。"}
{"id": "neg-02-dinov2-supervised", "question": "DINOv2 是用人工标注的分类标签做有监督预训练的吗？", "split": "dev", "type": "neg", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": true, "expectedFileMd5s": ["cf7a4fe0f316cba2a4727a24ba185527"], "expectedFileNames": ["02-dinov2-oquab-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["4"], "expectedEvidence": ["self-supervised"], "referenceAnswer": "不是。DINOv2 是自监督（self-supervised）预训练，不依赖人工标签；应纠正这个前提，而不是顺着「有监督」作答。"}
{"id": "fact-03-artifact-source", "question": "DVT 认为 ViT 特征图上网格状伪影的根源是什么？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0b4044f03691d6448c32dcc193efd210"], "expectedFileNames": ["03-denoising-vit-yang-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["5"], "expectedEvidence": ["positional embeddings"], "referenceAnswer": "输入阶段的位置嵌入（positional embeddings）——ViT 特征图上的网格伪影可以追溯到它。"}
{"id": "fact-03-two-stage", "question": "DVT 的两阶段去噪分别做什么？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0b4044f03691d6448c32dcc193efd210"], "expectedFileNames": ["03-denoising-vit-yang-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["6"], "expectedEvidence": ["neural fields", "lightweight transformer block"], "referenceAnswer": "第一阶段用神经场（neural fields）做逐图的跨视角特征一致性优化，把干净特征与被位置伪影污染的特征分开，为离线应用提供干净特征估计；第二阶段训练一个轻量 transformer 块（lightweight transformer block）从原始 ViT 输出预测干净特征，以第一阶段的估计为监督。"}
{"id": "fact-03-retraining", "question": "用 DVT 需要重新训练已有的预训练 ViT 吗？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0b4044f03691d6448c32dcc193efd210"], "expectedFileNames": ["03-denoising-vit-yang-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["7"], "expectedEvidence": ["immediately applicable"], "referenceAnswer": "不需要。DVT 不要求重训已有的预训练 ViT，可立即（immediately applicable）用于任何 Vision Transformer 架构。"}
