{"id": "para-03-stage1-purpose", "question": "为什么 DVT 第一阶段要做逐图优化？这些干净特征估计之后用在哪？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0b4044f03691d6448c32dcc193efd210"], "expectedFileNames": ["03-denoising-vit-yang-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["6"], "expectedEvidence": ["offline applications"], "referenceAnswer": "第一阶段的逐图（per-image）优化从原始 ViT 输出中提取无伪影特征，为离线应用（offline applications）提供干净特征估计；这些估计随后充当第二阶段通用去噪器的监督信号。"}
