{"id": "multi-03-denoiser-design", "question": "DVT 把 ViT 输出分解成哪几项？第二阶段训练的是什么？", "split": "dev", "type": "multi", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0b4044f03691d6448c32dcc193efd210"], "expectedFileNames": ["03-denoising-vit-yang-2024.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["33"], "expectedEvidence": ["artifact term G", "generalizable denoiser"], "referenceAnswer": "第一阶段把图像裁剪的原始特征分解为无噪语义项 F、与输入无关的位置相关伪影项 G，以及额外的残差项 ∆；第二阶段训练一个可泛化的去噪器（generalizable denoiser）从原始特征预测干净特征，推理时只需一次前向。"}
