{"id": "fact-04-unification", "question": "GenForce 把不同传感器的触觉信号统一成什么表示？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["3592bb7f2f9c3a7f1e7ce02e78747d6d"], "expectedFileNames": ["04-tactile-force-chen-2025.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["4"], "expectedEvidence": ["marker-based binary tactile images"], "referenceAnswer": "统一为基于标记点的二值触觉图像（marker-based binary tactile images），以缩小不同传感原理/结构的测量信号差距，类比人类手指间统一的触觉表示。"}
{"id": "fact-04-m2m", "question": "marker-to-marker 翻译在 GenForce 里起什么作用？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["3592bb7f2f9c3a7f1e7ce02e78747d6d"], "expectedFileNames": ["04-tactile-force-chen-2025.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["4"], "expectedEvidence": ["marker-to-marker translation"], "referenceAnswer": "跨传感器的标记点到标记点翻译（marker-to-marker translation）：把已有的成对力标签-触觉图像数据迁移到任意目标传感器，只需少量配对数据，无需为新传感器重新采集力标签。"}
