{"id": "fact-04-convgru", "question": "GenForce 的时空力预测模型用什么模块捕捉时间依赖？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["3592bb7f2f9c3a7f1e7ce02e78747d6d"], "expectedFileNames": ["04-tactile-force-chen-2025.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["125"], "expectedEvidence": ["ConvGRU"], "referenceAnswer": "卷积 GRU（ConvGRU）——隐藏状态 128 通道，在保持空间结构的同时捕捉时间依赖，并靠记忆机制区分加载/卸载状态。"}
{"id": "fact-04-cortex", "question": "GenForce 模仿了人类躯体感觉皮层的哪些能力？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["3592bb7f2f9c3a7f1e7ce02e78747d6d"], "expectedFileNames": ["04-tactile-force-chen-2025.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["21"], "expectedEvidence": ["unified tactile representation", "tactile memory"], "referenceAnswer": "三种能力：跨手指统一的触觉表示（unified tactile representation）、触觉记忆形成（tactile memory formation）和跨手指力校准（cross-finger force calibration），以此实现无监督力迁移与跨传感器校准。"}
