{"id": "fact-04-bioinspiration", "question": "为什么论文说统一触觉表示类比人类手上的动作电位？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["3592bb7f2f9c3a7f1e7ce02e78747d6d"], "expectedFileNames": ["04-tactile-force-chen-2025.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["31"], "expectedEvidence": ["action potentials"], "referenceAnswer": "统一的 marker-based binary tactile image 不论传感原理如何都给出一致的信号形态，就像动作电位（action potentials）在人类不同手指间传递统一的神经信号，从而实现跨手指/跨传感器的力信息互换。"}
