{"id": "fact-05-piezoelectric-constants", "question": "石英和钛酸钡的压电常数 k 的典型值分别是多少？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["6d7c6338432c26b14ce7a57932e47305"], "expectedFileNames": ["05-medical-instrumentation-ch2.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["94"], "expectedEvidence": ["2.3 pC/N", "140 pC/N"], "referenceAnswer": "石英约 2.3 pC/N，钛酸钡（barium titanate）约 140 pC/N。"}
{"id": "fact-05-lvdt", "question": "LVDT 由哪些部分组成？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["6d7c6338432c26b14ce7a57932e47305"], "expectedFileNames": ["05-medical-instrumentation-ch2.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["64"], "expectedEvidence": ["primary coil", "two secondary coils"], "referenceAnswer": "LVDT（线性可变差动变压器）由一个初级线圈（端子 a–b）和两个次级线圈组成，靠铁芯位置改变次级间的差值来测位移。"}
{"id": "fact-05-lvdt-accuracy", "question": "商用 LVDT 的线性度规格大概是什么水平？和应变片比灵敏度如何？", "split": "test", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["6d7c6338432c26b14ce7a57932e47305"], "expectedFileNames": ["05-medical-instrumentation-ch2.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["67"], "expectedEvidence": ["±0.25%"], "referenceAnswer": "线性度约 ±0.25%；LVDT 的灵敏度远高于应变片，缺点是需要更复杂的信号处理电路，还要配相敏解调器。"}
{"id": "fact-05-wheatstone", "question": "测量微小电阻变化最合适的电路是什么？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["6d7c6338432c26b14ce7a57932e47305"], "expectedFileNames": ["05-medical-instrumentation-ch2.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["29"], "expectedEvidence": ["Wheatstone bridge"], "referenceAnswer": "惠斯通电桥（Wheatstone bridge）——它是测量小电阻变化的理想电路，应变片通常接成四臂电桥使用。"}
{"id": "para-05-phase-sensitive", "question": "为什么 LVDT 和交流激励的应变片电桥输出要配相敏解调器？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["6d7c6338432c26b14ce7a57932e47305"], "expectedFileNames": ["05-medical-instrumentation-ch2.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["73"], "expectedEvidence": ["suppressed-carrier waveforms"], "referenceAnswer": "因为它们输出的是抑制载波（suppressed-carrier）的交流波形，只有相敏解调才能同时恢复幅值和方向（相位）信息——即区分位移/应变偏离的方向。"}
{"id": "para-05-pn-junction", "question": "用 p-n 结测温时，结电压随温度大约变化多少？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["6d7c6338432c26b14ce7a57932e47305"], "expectedFileNames": ["05-medical-instrumentation-ch2.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["67"], "expectedEvidence": ["2 mV"], "referenceAnswer": "p-n 结两端电压随温度约变化 2 mV/°C，基于该原理的温度传感器已经商用。"}
{"id": "multi-05-sensor-list", "question": "资料说尺寸（位移）变化可以由哪些原理转换成电信号？", "split": "dev", "type": "multi", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["6d7c6338432c26b14ce7a57932e47305"], "expectedFileNames": ["05-medical-instrumentation-ch2.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["6"], "expectedEvidence": ["inductance", "capacitance", "piezoelectric effect"], "referenceAnswer": "通过电阻、电感（inductance）、电容（capacitance）和压电效应（piezoelectric effect）的变化来测量。"}
{"id": "multi-05-temperature-methods", "question": "资料里提到的体温测量方法有哪些？", "split": "test", "type": "multi", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["6d7c6338432c26b14ce7a57932e47305"], "expectedFileNames": ["05-medical-instrumentation-ch2.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["2"], "expectedEvidence": ["thermocouples", "Fiber-Optic Temperature Sensors"], "referenceAnswer": "热敏电阻（thermistors）与热电偶（thermocouples）是主要方法，另有辐射测温（Radiation Thermometry）和光纤温度传感器（Fiber-Optic Temperature Sensors）。"}
{"id": "neg-05-beta", "question": "资料推荐热敏电阻的 β 材料常数取什么值测温最准？", "split": "dev", "type": "neg", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": true, "expectedFileMd5s": ["6d7c6338432c26b14ce7a57932e47305"], "expectedFileNames": ["05-medical-instrumentation-ch2.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["141"], "expectedEvidence": ["material constant for thermistor"], "referenceAnswer": "资料只把 β 定义为热敏电阻的材料常数（单位 K，出现在 Rt-R0 经验公式里），并没有给出任何推荐取值或「最准」的选择标准；不能编造数值。"}
{"id": "neg-05-peura-award", "question": "第 2 章作者 Robert A. Peura 是哪一年获得 AAMI 终身成就奖的？", "split": "test", "type": "neg", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": true, "expectedFileMd5s": ["6d7c6338432c26b14ce7a57932e47305"], "expectedFileNames": ["05-medical-instrumentation-ch2.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["1"], "expectedEvidence": ["Robert A. Peura"], "referenceAnswer": "资料只在章节署名处出现 Robert A. Peura（与 John G. Webster 合著第 2 章 BASIC SENSORS AND PRINCIPLES），没有任何获奖年份信息；不能编造。"}
{"id": "para-05-displacement-use", "question": "位移的直接测量在生理测量里用在什么地方？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["6d7c6338432c26b14ce7a57932e47305"], "expectedFileNames": ["05-medical-instrumentation-ch2.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["8"], "expectedEvidence": ["diameter of blood vessels", "cardiac chambers"], "referenceAnswer": "用于确定血管直径的变化以及心腔（cardiac chambers）容积与形状的变化，用以区分正常与异常功能。"}
{"id": "fact-06-author", "question": "这篇文章的作者是谁？她领导的公司叫什么？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["1"], "expectedEvidence": ["Daphne Koller", "insitro"], "referenceAnswer": "Daphne Koller，insitro 的创始人兼 CEO；这是她为 a16z 撰写的客座文章《Drug Discovery Has No Magic Wands》。"}
{"id": "fact-06-fail-rate", "question": "进入临床试验的药物有多大比例最终失败？这个数字近年改善了吗？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["12"], "expectedEvidence": ["enter clinical trials fail"], "referenceAnswer": "超过 90% 进入临床试验的药物失败（enter clinical trials fail）——几十年来这一 dismal statistic 几乎没有改善；多数情况下分子本身没问题，错的是针对的机制。"}
{"id": "fact-06-stages", "question": "文章把药物发现分解成哪三个基本阶段？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["6"], "expectedEvidence": ["Disease-to-mechanism", "Mechanism-to-drug", "Drug-to-patient"], "referenceAnswer": "1) Disease-to-mechanism：找到干预后能改变疾病进程的机制/通路/靶点；2) Mechanism-to-drug：用合适的治疗模态（小分子、抗体、siRNA、基因治疗等）做出安全、药理性质可接受的分子；3) Drug-to-patient：设计临床开发计划，找对病人并评估获益与不良反应。"}
{"id": "fact-06-targets-crowding", "question": "目前有多少个靶点上各有超过 50 个在研项目？文章拿什么药举的例子？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["14"], "expectedEvidence": ["38 targets"], "referenceAnswer": "38 个靶点各有 50 多个在研项目（38 targets that have over 50 programs against each of them）——文章问「我们到底需要多少种 GLP-1 变体？」，批评这是资本错配。"}
{"id": "fact-06-novel-targets", "question": "行业每年推进的新靶点数量从 2015 年到 2024 年发生了什么变化？", "split": "test", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["14"], "expectedEvidence": ["fell from ~100 in", "30 in 2024"], "referenceAnswer": "从 2015 年的约 100 个（~100 in 2015）跌到 2024 年的约 30 个（about 30 in 2024）；作者认为比资本错配更严重的代价，是数亿无药可用的病人得不到帮助。"}
{"id": "fact-06-modalities", "question": "文章认为历史上「攻克不可成药靶点」的最大进步来自哪里？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["7"], "expectedEvidence": ["therapeutic modalities", "siRNA", "gene editing"], "referenceAnswer": "不是更好的分子设计工具，而是治疗模态（therapeutic modalities）库的扩展：先是生物药（biologics），然后 siRNA 和反义寡核苷酸，再到基因编辑——每种新模态都打开了一类以前无法触及的靶点。"}
{"id": "para-06-keys-locks", "question": "作者用「钥匙和锁」的比喻说明药物研发的什么问题？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["12"], "expectedEvidence": ["manufacturing keys", "wrong locks"], "referenceAnswer": "我们在制造钥匙（分子）这件事上做得不错，但配的往往是错的锁（wrong locks）——即针对的机制不对。真正的瓶颈是疾病理解：找到「对的锁」（干预后真能改变疾病进程的机制），而不是更快地造钥匙。"}
{"id": "para-06-elephant", "question": "作者用什么比喻形容我们对人类生物学的理解程度？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["4"], "expectedEvidence": ["blind men and the elephant"], "referenceAnswer": "盲人摸象的寓言（the parable of the blind men and the elephant）——只不过这头象非常大；几百年现代医学之后，我们对多数疾病与健康生理的理解仍然片面。"}
{"id": "para-06-agents-loop", "question": "为什么 AI 智能体闭环在药物开发里不如在代码或分子设计上那么见效？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["26"], "expectedEvidence": ["fast, accurate, and cheap scorecard"], "referenceAnswer": "智能体迭代优化依赖一张快速、准确且便宜的成绩单（fast, accurate, and cheap scorecard）：编译器立刻验证代码、分子设计的反馈便宜快速，所以这两个领域进步飞快；而药物开发的终极成绩单——对病人的真实疗效——又慢又贵又难测，闭环转不起来。"}
{"id": "multi-06-magic-wands", "question": "文章批驳了哪几类「AI Magic Wand」叙事？", "split": "test", "type": "multi", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["6"], "expectedEvidence": ["AI Magic Wand"], "referenceAnswer": "文中逐一分析了多个 AI Magic Wand 叙事：1) AI 直接「drugging the undruggable」；2) 大模型读遍文献推理出新机制假设；3) AI 智能体+实验室自动化闭环做科研；4) 把临床试验的时间与成本大幅压缩（第四根魔杖）。作者认为它们各有价值但都不是魔杖。"}
{"id": "multi-06-quarter-diseases", "question": "有已批准疗法的疾病占多大比例？疗效如何？", "split": "dev", "type": "multi", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["3"], "expectedEvidence": ["a quarter of diseases"], "referenceAnswer": "按多数统计只有约四分之一（a quarter of diseases）——按某些估计只有几个百分点——的疾病有已批准疗法，而且其中大多数只是减缓疾病而不是阻止它。"}
{"id": "neg-06-koller-nobel", "question": "Daphne Koller 是哪一年拿到诺贝尔化学奖的？", "split": "dev", "type": "neg", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": true, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["1"], "expectedEvidence": ["Daphne Koller"], "referenceAnswer": "资料中没有任何诺贝尔奖信息——文章只介绍她是 insitro 创始人/CEO、在 AI 与生物学交叉领域工作约 30 年；应说明资料无此信息，不能编造年份。"}
{"id": "neg-06-avg-cost", "question": "这篇文章给出的一款新药平均研发成本是多少亿美元？", "split": "test", "type": "neg", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": true, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["12"], "expectedEvidence": ["clinical trials"], "referenceAnswer": "这篇文章没有给出「平均研发成本 X 亿美元」的数字——它引用的统计是 90% 临床失败率和新靶点数量从约 100 降到约 30；应说明资料中无该数字，不能编造。"}
{"id": "neg-06-first-drug", "question": "insitro 的第一个获批上市药物叫什么名字？", "split": "dev", "type": "neg", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": true, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["1"], "expectedEvidence": ["insitro"], "referenceAnswer": "资料只介绍 insitro 的方法论立场（scaled biology、deep causality）与作者的选择，没有提到任何上市药物；不能编造药名。"}
{"id": "para-06-antibodies-success", "question": "文章承认 AI 自动化系统已经在哪些任务上取得早期成功？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["26"], "expectedEvidence": ["cell-free protein synthesis", "designing antibodies"], "referenceAnswer": "优化无细胞蛋白质合成（cell-free protein synthesis）和针对已知靶点设计抗体（designing antibodies）——这些任务的反馈快速、准确、便宜，所以早期成功很诱人，但药物开发的终极反馈不具备这些性质。"}
{"id": "multi-06-data-chasm", "question": "为什么「LLM 读遍文献就能推理出新机制」这个叙事不成立？", "split": "test", "type": "multi", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["fcbea2542f131a72ab499a95c407256c"], "expectedFileNames": ["06-drug-discovery-a16z.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["15"], "expectedEvidence": ["Data Chasm of Human Biology"], "referenceAnswer": "因为该叙事假设科学界已经（或即将）收集了足够的人类生物学数据来包含答案，缺的只是推理——但实际上存在「人类生物学的数据鸿沟」（The Data Chasm of Human Biology）：生物学跨越 DNA、蛋白质、细胞、多细胞环境到整个生物体多个互联层次，是数十亿年混乱随机演化的产物，基因、细胞类型、状态与情境多到无法凭空推理；瓶颈在于测量生物学的方式，而不是推理能力。"}
{"id": "fact-08-mbr", "question": "MBR 为什么能根据操作系统类型加载对应的逻辑磁盘分区？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0f44c50208a7d942b3b80f22f313274c"], "expectedFileNames": ["08-os-review-zh.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["1"], "expectedEvidence": ["磁盘分区表"], "referenceAnswer": "因为 MBR 中包含磁盘分区表，所以能按操作系统类型加载对应的逻辑磁盘分区。"}
{"id": "fact-08-bios", "question": "BIOS 存放在内存还是外存？介质是 ROM 还是 RAM？为什么？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0f44c50208a7d942b3b80f22f313274c"], "expectedFileNames": ["08-os-review-zh.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["1"], "expectedEvidence": ["内存ROM"], "referenceAnswer": "存放在内存中、介质是 ROM——刚开机时只有内存里的指令才能被访问，而 ROM 才能在开机时保留指令。"}
{"id": "fact-08-mouse", "question": "操作系统对鼠标行为做出反馈利用了什么机制？这套联系是在哪个阶段建立的？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0f44c50208a7d942b3b80f22f313274c"], "expectedFileNames": ["08-os-review-zh.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["1"], "expectedEvidence": ["中断向量表", "操作系统初始化"], "referenceAnswer": "中断机制：因为在中断向量表中为鼠标点击注册了中断服务；这种「鼠标操作→系统反馈」联系的建立发生在操作系统初始化过程中。"}
{"id": "fact-08-pcb", "question": "用户程序能不能直接访问自己的 PCB？为什么？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0f44c50208a7d942b3b80f22f313274c"], "expectedFileNames": ["08-os-review-zh.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["3"], "expectedEvidence": ["PCB 在内核区域"], "referenceAnswer": "不能，因为 PCB 位于内核区域，用户态程序无权访问。"}
{"id": "fact-08-blocking-queue", "question": "所有处于阻塞态的进程都应该挂在同一个阻塞队列里吗？", "split": "test", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0f44c50208a7d942b3b80f22f313274c"], "expectedFileNames": ["08-os-review-zh.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["3"], "expectedEvidence": ["阻塞队列"], "referenceAnswer": "不应该。不同的阻塞条件各对应一个阻塞队列（等磁盘的和等网络的不该混在一个队列里），唤醒时按条件分别处理。"}
{"id": "fact-08-current", "question": "进程切换完成后，current 指针会发生什么变化？被换下的进程去了哪里？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0f44c50208a7d942b3b80f22f313274c"], "expectedFileNames": ["08-os-review-zh.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["3"], "expectedEvidence": ["current 指向新切换的进程"], "referenceAnswer": "current 指向新切换的进程；原本的当前进程进入就绪队列，并更新它的时间片。"}
{"id": "para-08-threads", "question": "同一进程内两个线程之间的切换，哪些切换会发生、哪些不会？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0f44c50208a7d942b3b80f22f313274c"], "expectedFileNames": ["08-os-review-zh.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["3"], "expectedEvidence": ["上下文切换和堆栈切换", "地址空间切换"], "referenceAnswer": "会发生上下文切换和堆栈切换，不会发生地址空间切换——同一进程的不同线程独占寄存器资源和堆栈，但共享地址空间（页表、段表等）。"}
{"id": "para-08-hardlink", "question": "硬链接和软链接的访问机制有什么区别？删掉一个硬链接后软链接还能用吗？", "split": "test", "type": "para", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0f44c50208a7d942b3b80f22f313274c"], "expectedFileNames": ["08-os-review-zh.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["31"], "expectedEvidence": ["链接计数加1", "绝对路径"], "referenceAnswer": "硬链接：读取原文件的 inode 及其编号 k，把该 inode 的链接计数加 1，再建一个指向同一 inode 编号的目录项；软链接：其文件内容存放的是目标文件的绝对路径，访问时按路径再找。删除硬链接 01.txt 后软链接 02.txt 仍可用——因为 02.txt 存的是 a.txt 的绝对路径，删一个目录项不影响按路径访问文件内容。"}
{"id": "fact-08-seek", "question": "访问一个磁盘扇区主要经历哪几个阶段？哪个最耗时？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0f44c50208a7d942b3b80f22f313274c"], "expectedFileNames": ["08-os-review-zh.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["24"], "expectedEvidence": ["寻道时间", "旋转延迟"], "referenceAnswer": "寻道时间、旋转延迟、访问（传输）时间三段，其中寻道时间是主要耗时操作；因此磁盘连续访问性能高（节约寻道时间），也可以用扇区交错分布来优化。"}
{"id": "neg-08-cfs", "question": "讲义里给的 Linux CFS 调度器默认时间片是多少毫秒？", "split": "dev", "type": "neg", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": true, "expectedFileMd5s": ["0f44c50208a7d942b3b80f22f313274c"], "expectedFileNames": ["08-os-review-zh.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["3"], "expectedEvidence": ["就绪队列"], "referenceAnswer": "讲义没有提到 CFS（完全公平调度器）或任何默认时间片数值——它只讨论了用堆（优先级队列）组织就绪队列、切换后更新时间片等概念；应说明资料中无此信息，不能编造毫秒数。"}
{"id": "fact-09-biointerface", "question": "讲义里 biointerface 的定义是什么？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["75fc40341c3b0caebddfe0600a3bf119"], "expectedFileNames": ["09-bme6144-week6-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["6"], "expectedEvidence": ["material interacts with biological"], "referenceAnswer": "biointerface 是材料与生物分子、细胞或体液发生相互作用（material interacts with biological molecules, cells or fluids）的区域；典型分层为：生物样本 → 靶蛋白/细胞 → 固定的识别分子 → 连接层/功能涂层 → 基底材料（玻璃/金/聚合物）。"}
{"id": "fact-09-equation", "question": "running case 里芯片测得信号由哪几部分组成？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["75fc40341c3b0caebddfe0600a3bf119"], "expectedFileNames": ["09-bme6144-week6-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["5"], "expectedEvidence": ["Snonspecific", "Sbackground"], "referenceAnswer": "Smeasured = Sspecific + Snonspecific + Sbackground + Snoise——测得信号 = 特异性捕获信号 + 非特异吸附信号 + 背景信号 + 噪声；表面设计的目标就是压低后三项、保住第一项。"}
{"id": "fact-09-antifouling", "question": "幻灯片列出了哪些抗吸附（non-fouling）策略？", "split": "test", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["75fc40341c3b0caebddfe0600a3bf119"], "expectedFileNames": ["09-bme6144-week6-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["17"], "expectedEvidence": ["PEG or polymer brushes", "Zwitterionic coatings", "Hydrogels"], "referenceAnswer": "水化聚合物涂层、PEG 或聚合物刷（PEG or polymer brushes）、两性离子涂层（Zwitterionic coatings）、水凝胶（Hydrogels）、表面封闭（surface blocking）、光滑一致的表面制备、选择性固定化、合适的流动与清洗条件；同时提醒：低吸附层仍必须允许识别元件接近目标。"}
{"id": "fact-09-aptes", "question": "APTES 硅烷化修饰在什么表面上进行？生成什么？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["75fc40341c3b0caebddfe0600a3bf119"], "expectedFileNames": ["09-bme6144-week6-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["29"], "expectedEvidence": ["APTES", "silane monolayer"], "referenceAnswer": "在含氧化物的表面（如玻璃）上进行：表面羟基（—OH）基团与 APTES 反应，形成顶端带功能基的硅烷单分子层（silane monolayer），反应式 Surface–OH + silane–Si(OR)₃ → Surface–O–Si–R。"}
{"id": "para-09-plasma", "question": "等离子体处理对聚合物表面有什么作用？为什么处理效果会随时间退化？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["75fc40341c3b0caebddfe0600a3bf119"], "expectedFileNames": ["09-bme6144-week6-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["26"], "expectedEvidence": ["hydrophobic recovery"], "referenceAnswer": "等离子体在表面引入 –OH、–C=O、–COOH 等含氧基团使表面亲水；但疏水恢复（hydrophobic recovery）会把表面逐渐拉回原本的疏水状态——聚合物表面可能随时间重新变得不亲水。"}
{"id": "para-09-week5-6", "question": "课程 Week 5 和 Week 6 各自回答什么问题？衔接关系是什么？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["75fc40341c3b0caebddfe0600a3bf119"], "expectedFileNames": ["09-bme6144-week6-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["3"], "expectedEvidence": ["Can the device be bonded?", "What happens at the channel surface?"], "referenceAnswer": "Week 5（材料→图形→结构→键合）问的是工程问题：通道能否制造、器件能否键合（Can the device be bonded?）、芯片会不会漏液、PDMS 或玻璃结构上是否合适；Week 6（表面→识别→生物响应）问的是表面问题：通道表面会发生什么（What happens at the channel surface?）、目标生物分子能否结合、样品能否给出特异性信号、表面在生物学上是否合适。一句话：机械上能用的器件还需要生物学上能用的表面。"}
{"id": "fact-09-course-info", "question": "这份讲义属于哪门课、哪个星期、授课教师是谁？", "split": "test", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["75fc40341c3b0caebddfe0600a3bf119"], "expectedFileNames": ["09-bme6144-week6-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["1"], "expectedEvidence": ["BME6144", "Dongwei Wu"], "referenceAnswer": "BME6144《Biochip Design and Applications》Week 6：Surface Engineering and Biointerfaces，授课教师 Dr. Dongwei Wu。"}
{"id": "fact-09-contact-angle", "question": "接触角 θ 是怎么测量的？大小代表什么？", "split": "test", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["75fc40341c3b0caebddfe0600a3bf119"], "expectedFileNames": ["09-bme6144-week6-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["20"], "expectedEvidence": ["measured through the liquid"], "referenceAnswer": "接触角 θ 是透过液体一侧测量（measured through the liquid）的：角度小→亲水（hydrophilic），角度大→疏水（hydrophobic）；它描述润湿性，是预测表面行为的关键指标之一。"}
{"id": "neg-09-gold-price", "question": "讲义建议实验室采购的金基底玻片单价是多少？", "split": "dev", "type": "neg", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": true, "expectedFileMd5s": ["75fc40341c3b0caebddfe0600a3bf119"], "expectedFileNames": ["09-bme6144-week6-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["6"], "expectedEvidence": ["glass / gold / polymer"], "referenceAnswer": "讲义只把金（gold）作为基底材料选项之一列出（Base material: glass / gold / polymer），没有任何采购价格信息；应说明资料中无此信息，不能编造价格。"}
{"id": "fact-10-electrode-transducer", "question": "在生物电测量里，电极扮演什么角色？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["4ca04ccacafaed5689b266026dae6e34"], "expectedFileNames": ["10-bme6111-week4-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["3"], "expectedEvidence": ["ionic current", "electronic current"], "referenceAnswer": "电极就是这一周的换能器：把组织中的离子电流（ionic current）转换为导线中的电子电流（electronic current）——Week 4 的被测量本身已是电信号（biopotential），经调理放大滤波后成为可见的 ECG/EEG/EMG 信号。"}
{"id": "fact-10-pump", "question": "静息膜电位为什么存在？靠什么机制维持？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["4ca04ccacafaed5689b266026dae6e34"], "expectedFileNames": ["10-bme6111-week4-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["7"], "expectedEvidence": ["Na+/K+ pump"], "referenceAnswer": "因为离子梯度：K+ 在细胞内浓度高、Na+ 在细胞外浓度高；Na+/K+ 泵（Na+/K+ pump）维持这些梯度。"}
{"id": "fact-10-ap-phases", "question": "动作电位经历哪几个阶段？各阶段离子怎么流动？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["4ca04ccacafaed5689b266026dae6e34"], "expectedFileNames": ["10-bme6111-week4-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["8"], "expectedEvidence": ["depolarization", "repolarization", "hyperpolarization"], "referenceAnswer": "1) Na+ 通道开放→去极化（depolarization）；2) K+ 外流→复极化（repolarization）；3) 随后短暂超极化（hyperpolarization）。电导上 gNa 先升、gK 后升，各阶段电位由 Nernst 方程决定。"}
{"id": "fact-10-ecg-waves", "question": "ECG 的主要波形成分分别对应心脏的什么电事件？", "split": "test", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["4ca04ccacafaed5689b266026dae6e34"], "expectedFileNames": ["10-bme6111-week4-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["12"], "expectedEvidence": ["atrial depolarization", "ventricular depolarization", "ventricular repolarization"], "referenceAnswer": "P 波对应心房去极化（atrial depolarization），QRS 波群对应心室去极化（ventricular depolarization），T 波对应心室复极化（ventricular repolarization）。"}
{"id": "fact-10-half-cell", "question": "电极的半电池电位由哪些因素决定？", "split": "dev", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["4ca04ccacafaed5689b266026dae6e34"], "expectedFileNames": ["10-bme6111-week4-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["25"], "expectedEvidence": ["half-cell potential"], "referenceAnswer": "金属与电解液界面处的电荷分离在无净电流时也会产生电压——平衡电压即半电池电位（half-cell potential，Ehc），由电极材料、离子浓度和温度决定（哪一侧为正取决于金属）。"}
{"id": "para-10-agagcl", "question": "为什么 Ag/AgCl 电极被广泛用于（慢）生物电记录？", "split": "dev", "type": "para", "difficulty": 3, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["4ca04ccacafaed5689b266026dae6e34"], "expectedFileNames": ["10-bme6111-week4-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["29"], "expectedEvidence": ["Ag/AgCl", "little polarization"], "referenceAnswer": "因为极化小的界面在电流通过时电压变化小，记录更稳定——对慢生物电位尤其如此；Ag/AgCl 接近理想的非极化（non-polarizable）界面，因此广泛使用。"}
{"id": "fact-10-oxidation", "question": "电极-电解液界面上发生的氧化/还原反应是什么？为什么重要？", "split": "test", "type": "fact", "difficulty": 2, "expectedRefusal": false, "expectedFileMd5s": ["4ca04ccacafaed5689b266026dae6e34"], "expectedFileNames": ["10-bme6111-week4-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["24"], "expectedEvidence": ["releases electrons", "accepts electrons"], "referenceAnswer": "氧化（Oxidation）是释放电子的反应，还原（Reduction）是接受电子的反应；金属侧由电子载流、电解液侧由阳离子/阴离子载流，正是这些电极反应把体内的离子导电与导线中的电子导电连接起来。"}
{"id": "neg-10-budget", "question": "BME 6111 课程实验用的电极耗材预算是多少美元？", "split": "dev", "type": "neg", "difficulty": 1, "expectedRefusal": true, "expectedFileMd5s": ["4ca04ccacafaed5689b266026dae6e34"], "expectedFileNames": ["10-bme6111-week4-slides.pdf"], "expectedChunkIds": ["1"], "expectedEvidence": ["Biomedical Instrumentation"], "referenceAnswer": "这是课程讲义（BME 6111 — Biomedical Instrumentation，Week 4：Biopotentials and electrodes），只讲电极原理与类型，没有任何耗材预算信息；应说明资料中无此信息，不能编造数字。"}
